</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0009" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0017" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0028" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B5F00001">
<testtitle>Inspect Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the center position. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFE009X_02_0046"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the spiral cable under the following conditions.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141931J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>After setting the spiral cable to the center position, measure the resistance at the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise and at the position turned 2.5 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise from the center position, and measure the resistance while turning it 5.0 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A1(HO) - C8(HO)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not turn the spiral cable more than the specified number of turns, as it may break.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0027" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0018" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000005QO01CX_01_0027">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness and Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
